===persian===

خاکستری
خاکستری
خاکستری
مه باران صبح
نگاه خاطره ابر
در من ترانه ای نبود تو خواندی
در من آینه ای نبود تو دیدی
ریشه ای بودم در خواب خاکهای متبرک
بی باران در نگاه تو سبز شدم
برقی از چشمانت برخاست
نگاهم بارانی شد
گونه هایت خیس باران
چشم هایت آفتابی
گرگ ها میزایند
بره ها را دریابیم...
تو با چشمانت مرا بنواز
چوبدست چوپانیم سلاحی کارگر خواهد شد
بعد از جنگ
با چوبدستم انجیرهای تازه را
برای تو خواهم چید
با تو خواهم ماند
با تو خواهم خواند
و تو را در بهت آفتابیت
خواهم بوسید
اگر ابرها بگذارند...

پاییز ۱۳۶۱

===machine===

gray
gray
gray
morning rain fog
cloud memory look
There was no song in me, you sang it.
There was no mirror in me, you saw.
I was a root in the dream of the blessed soil.
I became green in your eyes without rain.
A spark came from your eyes.
My eyes became cloudy
Your cheeks are wet with rain
Your eyes are sunny
The wolves are coming
Let's find the lambs...
You play with me with your eyes.
Our shepherd's staff will become a useful weapon.
after the war
I pluck fresh figs with my stick.
I will pick for you
I will stay with you
I will read with you
And you are in the sun's glare.
i will kiss
If the clouds leave...

Autumn 1361

===lantern===

Grey,
grey,
grey:
the morning's rain-mist,
the gaze, the cloud's remembering.
There was no song in me — you sang it.
There was no mirror in me — you saw.
I was a root asleep in the blessed soil;
with no rain, I greened in your gaze.
A lightning lifted from your eyes
and my own gaze turned to rain.
Your cheeks wet with rain,
your eyes full of sun.
The wolves are whelping —
let us gather in the lambs...
Play me with your eyes.
My shepherd's staff will turn into a working weapon.
After the war,
with that same staff I'll pick fresh figs for you,
I'll stay with you,
I'll sing with you,
and I'll kiss you in your sunlit daze —
if the clouds will let me...

Autumn 1361

